=== entry 08d70818a9ad
kind: translation
rules: paths
intent: The copy goes to the project skills folder, `.agents/skills/`, or a personal one (`~/.agents/skills/` for Codex, `~/.claude/skills/` for Claude Code); the personal folders go beyond the paths rule, which only names project skills. `plugins/cache/` stays, since Claude Code's plugin skills sit under `~/.claude/plugins/cache/`. Preserve show-before-approval, copy-then-edit, and no PR or push.
--- upstream
Never edit a skill under `plugins/cache/`. Before approval, show its destination, `.cursor/skills/<skill>/` or `~/.cursor/skills/<skill>/`. After approval, copy the skill folder there and edit the copy. Never open a PR or push.
--- patched
Never edit a skill under `plugins/cache/`. Before approval, show its destination, `.agents/skills/<skill>/` in the project, or `~/.agents/skills/<skill>/` (Codex) or `~/.claude/skills/<skill>/` (Claude Code) for a personal skill. After approval, copy the skill folder there and edit the copy. Never open a PR or push.

